column19:
Energy consumption figures can be found in the CO2 account, and are a combination of electricity, district heating, individual heating and town gas. The renewable energy share of consumption is calculated based on the energy consumption figures times the share of renewable electricity, district heating and town gas, available on the following websites: 
https://ens.dk/analyser-og-statistik/noegletal-om-energiforbrug-og-forsyning (excel version, El fra vedvarende energi - andel af indenlandsk elforsyning [pct.]); 
https://www.hofor.dk/baeredygtige-byer/beregn-co2/miljoedeklarationer/miljoedeklaration-for-fjernvarme/; 
https://www.hofor.dk/baeredygtige-byer/beregn-co2/miljoedeklarationer/miljoedeklaration-for-bygas/.
